id: hac-yt85
title: Clean-runner PM history drift blocks scheduled auto release
description: Scheduled Auto Release issue 79 repeatedly fails because a fresh checkout detects chain mismatches in four service-action lineage histories that a warm runtime cache can hide.
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 0
tags[5]: auto-release,github-actions,history-drift,pm,regression
