author: codex-root
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: pm validate --check-history-drift reports zero drift after clearing runtime cache; A clean archive or equivalent fresh-runner release verification passes the PM history gate; Auto-release dry run reaches a terminal non-failure result without publishing; GitHub issue 79 is linked and closed only after hosted proof
definition_of_ready: "Runs 30331944063, 30425623136, 30516542480, and 30607930160 inspected; dry-run repair identifies exactly four affected streams and preserves current item documents"
goal: reliable-conditional-daily-release
objective: repair-service-action-history-chain
value: Restore deterministic daily release automation on clean GitHub runners.
impact: Prevents all future changes from being blocked before build/test/release evaluation.
outcome: Fresh runners and warm workspaces agree on zero PM history drift.
why_now: Every scheduled release since the service-action merge has failed at the PM integrity gate.
