repro_steps: "Clear PM runtime cache or use a fresh checkout, then run pm validate --check-history-drift; observe four chain mismatches in hac-97on, hac-ahkf, hac-ndoh, and hac-stpm."
expected_result: Fresh checkout strict PM validation reports no history drift and release verification proceeds.
actual_result: "Scheduled run 30607930160 exits during quality:pm with validate_history_drift_chain_mismatches:4."
affected_version: 2026.7.26
component: pm-history/release
regression: true
customer_impact: Conditional daily releases cannot prepare or publish any repository changes.
