notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T20:22:44.377Z",codex-root,The initial cached local validation was a false negative; pm gc --scope runtime made the checkout reproduce the clean-runner failure.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T20:22:44.377Z",codex-root,"Release integrity checks must invalidate derived history-drift caches when item/history content changes, or clean-runner parity can diverge."
